  <name>Kartend</name>
  <summary>Organize and launch multimedia collections</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.etheraura">
    <name>EtherAura</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Kartend is a KDE-friendly Qt frontend for organizing, browsing, and launching
      multimedia collections with custom launchers.
    </p>
    <p>
      It supports large libraries through virtual scrolling, asynchronous artwork
      loading, collection hierarchies, persistent sessions, keyboard navigation,
      metadata sidebars, and configurable launch commands for media, emulators,
      RetroArch cores, or native applications.
    </p>
  </description>
